msgctxt "KeyConfigurationMergeDeletionDialogText"
msgid ""
"New controls have been introduced into the game, but upon loading your "
"configuration, it was discovered that you already have the controls that are "
"reserved as default controls installed. Due to this, new controls have been "
"removed in favor of yours. We strongly recommend that you go to Settings, go "
"to the \"controls Configuration\" tab and configure new actions. You can "
"find a list of new actions in the changelog."
msgstr ""
"Se han introducido nuevos controles en el juego, pero al cargar tu "
"configuración, se descubrió que ya tienes los controles que están reservados "
"como controles predeterminados instalados. Debido a esto, se han eliminado "
"nuevos controles a favor de los tuyos. Recomendamos encarecidamente que "
"vayas a Configuración, a la pestaña \"Configuración de controles\" y "
"configures nuevas acciones. Puedes encontrar una lista de nuevas acciones en "
"el ChangeLog."

